 mines, garages, and trebuchets, then strengthen them to power your growing war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tribes with Attitude</strong> \u2013 Pick from Beasts, Ronin, Mad, Knights, Slashers, and Synths. Each has their own abilities, units, and distinctive style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly Replayable</strong> \u2013 Short campaigns packed with unpredictable encounters, escalating wars, and upgrades that turn your ragtag army into an unstoppable band of maniacs.</p>","developers":["Burning Bagel Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/7771c2a1fe7f011037fdf3c5fee9705e13e9869a/header.jpg?t=1772408032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Apple GPU or Radeon Pro 560X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13 (Ventura) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 / Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M2 GPU or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3377150/1457795872/1b0d97a3aee7579ad698dd49d4b5cedac395c1cc/1770839966/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770844495","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3377150/1457795872/1b0d97a3aee7579ad698dd49d4b5cedac395c1cc/1770839966/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770844495","highlight":tru